/** Complete player-facing rules for every coded Fantasy Arcade activity.
 * Written against the shipped engines (0.5.2). Used by the in-app Rulebook panel and compiled into the
 * "Fantasy Arcade Rulebook" journal compendium by tools/build-journal.mjs. Pure data: no Foundry globals. */

const solo='Independent challenge: every seat plays its own copy, side by side, and the shared leaderboard compares final scores. Add AI rivals or GM-controlled NPCs for company.';
const arenaCore='Arena turn: you have 2 action points (AP). Choose an ability, then click a highlighted square (or use a self-targeted ability). Stamina and focus pay for abilities; at the start of your turn you regain 2 stamina and 1 focus, your guard fades by 1 and cooldowns tick down.';
const arenaDamage='Damage = the ability’s base + half your Power (rounded down) + 0–2 + any Aim bonus. The target subtracts its Guard, Dodge bonus, +2 if standing in cover and +2 if hidden (maximum 10 total); an exposed target takes +2. Each hit strips 2 Guard.';

